[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "And when I think about",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.38
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "what Nathan did,",
    "start": 1.38,
    "end": 2.18
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "and when I think about",
    "start": 2.18,
    "end": 2.96
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "what people here do,",
    "start": 2.96,
    "end": 3.96
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I think about ideas.",
    "start": 3.98,
    "end": 5.52
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "And I think about the idea",
    "start": 5.72,
    "end": 6.92
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "that creating an idea,",
    "start": 6.92,
    "end": 9.24
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "spreading an idea",
    "start": 9.32,
    "end": 10.36
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "has a lot behind it.",
    "start": 10.36,
    "end": 12.46
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "I don't know",
    "start": 13.2,
    "end": 13.62
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "if you've ever been",
    "start": 13.62,
    "end": 14.48
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "to a Jewish wedding,",
    "start": 14.48,
    "end": 15.32
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "but what they do is,",
    "start": 15.38,
    "end": 17.18
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "they take a light bulb",
    "start": 17.18,
    "end": 18.28
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "and they smash it.",
    "start": 18.28,
    "end": 21.2
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Now there is a bunch of reasons",
    "start": 21.2,
    "end": 22.2
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "for that.",
    "start": 23.98,
    "end": 24.48
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "But one reason is",
    "start": 25.48,
    "end": 27.06
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "because it indicates a change,",
    "start": 27.06,
    "end": 28.64
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "from before to after.",
    "start": 28.64,
    "end": 30.76
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It is a moment in time.",
    "start": 30.76,
    "end": 31.76
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "And I want to argue",
    "start": 32.7,
    "end": 33.82
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "that we are living through",
    "start": 33.82,
    "end": 35.7
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "and are right at",
    "start": 35.7,
    "end": 36.38
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "the key moment",
    "start": 36.38,
    "end": 37.16
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "of a change",
    "start": 37.16,
    "end": 38.08
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "in the way ideas are created",
    "start": 38.08,
    "end": 39.5
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "and spread",
    "start": 39.5,
    "end": 40.22
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "and implemented.",
    "start": 40.22,
    "end": 40.98
  }
]